    "cases.hand_over_a_cobie_facility_export.step.build.in.model": "निर्यात करण्यासाठी मॉडेल",
    "cases.hand_over_a_cobie_facility_export.step.build.out.workbook": "COBie 2.4 कार्यपुस्तिका",
